-- title:
--   Exact numerical data for the eight first-cell E8 interval jet graphs
-- statement:
--   At dyadic precision $160$, these literal integer interval jets record the stable graph and inverse recurrence for the four center inputs and four whole-cell inputs of the first E8 cell. Each jet stores six intervals, for the value and first five raw derivatives. The data includes every intermediate graph interval and each final qJetBox. Separate executable equality checks and soundness theorems certify that these literal records enclose the canonical inverse derivatives; this bundle supplies the exact source data only.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/dpwoodru/general-courtade-kumar-lean/tree/04b6fc3f75b10c3c43702a883ddf888b0608a9a0/browse/GeneralCK

